    "description": {
      "content": "HTTP surface of the Chronon fetcher service that powers Zipline AI online feature serving and schema inspection. These endpoints read from the online KV store and metadata uploaded during deploy, and are intended for online GroupBys and Joins. This document was generated by the API Evangelist enrichment pipeline from the provider's published documentation (https://zipline.ai/docs/setup/Fetcher_API); the provider does not publish an OpenAPI definition. Fetcher runs self-hosted within the customer's cloud, so the server host is deployment-specific.",
